{"title": "Contents", "index": 1, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\"><div class=\"sgc-toc-title\">目录</div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_000.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_1\">封面</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_000.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_2\">前言 哲学，人生的最佳解答！</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_3\">Chapter 1：古代</a><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_4\">“一厢情愿”等于无知</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_5\">另一个世界真实存在吗？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_6\">我们活着的目的是什么？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_7\">如何才能得到幸福？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_8\">什么是“遵循自然生活”？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_9\">年纪愈大，人生愈快乐！</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_10\">抛开执着，一切痛苦都能消除</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_11\">人类言谈举止的基础</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_001.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_12\">无所作为，便能水到渠成</a></div></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_13\">Chapter 2 中世纪—近代</a><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_14\">何谓完全、永恒、终极的存在？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_15\">人能接近神到什么程度？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_16\">人就是小宇宙</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_17\">政治与道德必须分开</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_18\">我思故我在</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_19\">无论过去还是未来，早就决定好了</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_20\">世界充满了能量！</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_21\">学会科学思考吧！</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_22\">人，有选择的自由</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_23\">其实物质存在于心中</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_24\">为什么知道“球丢出去就会飞”？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_25\">人是会思考的芦苇</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_26\">人生而自由，却无所不在枷锁中</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_27\">能自我控制，才是真正的自由</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_28\">因为有矛盾，才能趋近真实</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_002.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_29\">不觉悟，人生就只有苦恼</a></div></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_30\">Chapter 3：现代①：存在主义、现象学、社会主义</a><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_31\">人是追求快乐、逃避痛苦的动物</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_32\">努力向高品质的快乐迈进</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_33\">只要结果是好的，就万事OK</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_34\">知识与思考都只是工具，结果才有价值</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_35\">历史会以固定的轨迹前进</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_36\">什么是我能为它而死的真理？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_37\">“上帝已死”</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_38\">叩问内心，真实就会浮现</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_39\">“向死而生”</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_40\">人类是什么？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_41\">人是自我建构的存在</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_42\">为何我能了解他人的内在感受？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_43\">他人是不会让你如愿的</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_003.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_44\">保持好心情才会幸福</a></div></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_45\">Chapter 4：现代②：结构主义、后现代、分析哲学</a><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_46\">潜意识里的秘密</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_47\">人类有共同的原型</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_48\">决定意识的是未来的目标</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_49\">为什么会出现希特勒？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_50\">从争论中学习</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_51\">先有实物还是先有语言？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_52\">历史并非以直线进步</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_53\">“知识”的形态会随时代而改变</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_54\">社会进入“小叙事”时代</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_55\">消费时代，商品成为一种符号</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_56\">一切都是“欲望的机器”？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_57\">真与假，无法一线区隔</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_58\">什么是“真正的马克思主义”</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_59\">为什么会出现独裁者？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_60\">用符号来解读世界</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_61\">复制让美好消失</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_62\">今天的“帝国”到底是什么？</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_63\">用“无知之幕”看到正义</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_64\">失去希望，会导致死亡</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_65\">想辨明真伪，使用符号逻辑就够了</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_66\">语言的限度就是世界的限度</a></div></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_67\">参考文献</a></div><div class=\"sgc-toc-level\"><a class=\"calibre1\" href=\"Section0001_split_004.xhtml#sigil_toc_id_68\">结语 变，是唯一的不变</a></div></body>"}]}